[{"client_msg_id":"cfe43d2b-27ff-400a-afc4-b2f0e09d7208","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"クライアントの作り次第では VSCode みたいにもできなくはないと思うので。もしかしたら coc-explorer なんかは明示的にワークスペースフォルダを登録するのをサポートしてるかもしれませんね。","ts":"1617185973.084700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T4TR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe9cbe2a-4db5-44a9-a0d3-5cd9a064b2ab","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"僕の知る限りでは vim の LSP クライアントで複数ワークスペースに自然に対応できているものを知らない。　くらいに捉えていただければｗ","ts":"1617185944.084100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"haisyou","count":1,"users":["UFP0GQZ4K"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XtA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d9a7825-df18-421e-8711-b21829b1efc6","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"\u003c@U8R597E9H\u003e \u003c@UAZ33BKV2\u003e 回答していただき、ありがとうございました！とても勉強になりました！","ts":"1617185557.083300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fXy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7739b715-737c-4e0c-8da0-1c4f9e9b41cd","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"そんな感じです！","ts":"1617185450.082500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WGox"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b23f7ad-86ae-4969-9e5f-be59d0714a41","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"VimのLSPクライアントは1のワークスペースを想定する作りで、クライアントはworkspacel/*を使ってサーバが認識できているそのワークスペースすべてに影響を及ぼす作用を起せる、のはほぼ同義かな?","ts":"1617185323.082200","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1617185582.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IUW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"135e8236-6dad-4498-8c38-34d18aea2fc1","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"うまく言葉にできないですが、\nVim の LSP クライアントには１つのワークスペースがあって、クライアントは workspace/* を使ってすべてに影響を及ぼす のような感じですかね...？","ts":"1617185111.080500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Fvh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0c7e4c0-d7ee-4e6e-a3dc-5f2f2183f90c","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"たしかに、メソッド名的にも workspace/* はワークスペース単位で処理するという認識でよさそうですね。","ts":"1617184913.078400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o7Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48bdd85a-9167-470e-bf37-aa2ea91a5d52","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"LSP のプロトコル的には\n- workspace\n  - folders\n    - textdocuments\nこういう階層っぽいですが、フォルダ単位でのプロトコルはないっぽいですね。","ts":"1617184843.077600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mrS4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb9ac9fa-c26a-43c2-9e82-a37982b4ae8a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"なので、workspace/applyEdit になってるんだと思います。","ts":"1617184803.076600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uYag"}]},{"client_msg_id":"023f2d08-e10b-4e40-8009-5a7a9d80fb1f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"わかりやすい例はあんまり思い浮かばないですが、例えば `nvim-compe` 側で関数名をリネームしたとして、その変更は同一ワークスペースの `compe-tabnine` 側にも適用されて欲しいと思います。（理想的な LS があると仮定して。ですが）","ts":"1617184781.076100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lsO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"271adc12-bd52-468f-8ad2-0092394546b9","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"概念上の区切りっていうのもありそうです。例えば `nvim-compe` のファイルで `workspace/applyEdit` が発動したとしても、`compe-tabnine` に影響を及ぼしうる。というニュアンス的なものかなと。","ts":"1617184669.074500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UuKh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17ba9e14-5631-453e-9f8d-62bfb7cb45ec","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"A Project : /hoge /fuga\nB Project: /foo /bar\nのモノレポがあったとき、hogeとfugaは同じワークスペースになってほしいけど、foo barはなってほしくない(そっちでワークスペースになる)みたいなのかな?","ts":"1617184656.074200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"shl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ae76996-ed09-428c-a462-a3b7dad7b07b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"おそらく、workspace/* 系は「ワークスペース単位」の動きをするんだと思います。","ts":"1617184533.071600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NLI/t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f464a47-c875-46e8-ab00-5e8330ca1b6d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"大体の vim における LSP クライアントは、（暗黙的に）常に単一ワークスペースが開いていると仮定して、ファイルを開くたびに root_uri チェックして、新しいルートだった場合はそれを WorkspaceFolder として LS に通知する。みたいな戦略が多い気がする。","ts":"1617184507.071100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/iboy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40feda2f-0d92-49c9-85f2-ae8a7f51d07f","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"考え方は理解できたのですが、これって、 LSP 的に何かうれしいことってあるのでしょうか...？\nworkspace/* を使うことで、そのワークスペースにリクエストや通知をできるってことでしょうか？","ts":"1617184475.070400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AARe4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cadd1dc2-9406-43a6-a8fb-e35876d16d15","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"ふむふむ、VSCode はそんなこともできるのですね！\n今、試しにやってみたら、１つのワークスペースにたくさんプロジェクトを入れられました。","ts":"1617184418.068900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r04eu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f913cce3-17e1-4828-91b3-76e20ea2d6c8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"`/home/hrsh7th/develop/nvim-compe`\n`/home/hrsh7th/vim-plugin/compe-tabnine`\n`/home/hrsh7th/vim-plugin/compe-zsh`\nみたいに、ディレクトリ的に離れた場所にあってもワークスペースは食ってくれる。","ts":"1617184220.068000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YFSP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7552c52-8e1a-40cc-92a4-66992dd22bc1","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"つまり、ワークスペースというものはあくまでも概念で、実態めいたものは存在しないんですよね。（しいていえば、ワークスペース単位の設定値を保持する json ファイルはどこかに存在するとは思うのでそれでしょうか）","ts":"1617184146.067200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fRbz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fc31fdb-73a3-491f-8542-61149149c617","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"nvim-compe ワークスペース\n  - nvim-compe\n  - compe-tabnine\n  - compe-zsh\n\nこういう状態を作れます。（そして、この nvim-compe/compe-tabnine/compe-zsh などが `WorkspaceFolder` です。）","ts":"1617184099.066200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gTQo7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e64daf7-fd53-4cc4-8708-78f9511da733","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"VSCode では workspace に複数のルートをもったディレクトリをたくさん突っ込むことができて","ts":"1617184039.065100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d+kZZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5c964f1-9ab5-468c-903a-e9f24544c728","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"すみません。別の疑問が出てきてしまいまして、いいでしょうか...\nVSCode をほとんど使っていないので、わからないのですが、 ワークスペース = プロジェクト ということなのでしょうか？\nそうだった場合、workspace/* の workspace と ワークスペース (プロジェクト) は何か関係があるのでしょうか？","ts":"1617183960.064700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cyusj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6d31634-ebad-46a8-87e1-bb6bf3a2f8f7","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ﾜｸﾜｸ","ts":"1617183816.062400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XXPv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f49a8b1a-39f8-4b95-a122-84be25bc68e1","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"ほとんど同じという認識にしておこうと思います","ts":"1617183801.061900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"az/Ia"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95cf349d-dae4-4813-8c15-f71b4d31f6fe","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"言語的には大概プロジェクトで統一でしょうからね、なんか特殊なのはあるだろうけど","ts":"1617183755.061500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+4m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc2b00e2-389d-472e-a511-451ec77a824e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ほとんどのケースで、同一視してもよいとは思いますが。","ts":"1617183668.059800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F=N55"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a910811-6966-4954-a09a-c569ada60a3e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"もしそうだとしたら、workspace/didChangeConfiguration はエディタ搭載のワークスペース設定に関してだけ発動して、\nworkspace/configuration はファイル単位で上書き設定できるようなものを考慮した設定を返すべき。となる。","ts":"1617183656.059500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wlK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2014d5e4-2b82-47c6-b2b5-1597835f3b98","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/language-server-protocol/blob/gh-pages/_specifications/specification-3-16.md#workspace_configuration\u003e\nここの「EditorConfig みたいなのがある場合〜」みたいな言及を見て予想しています。","ts":"1617183598.058600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: microsoft/language-server-protocol","id":1,"title":"microsoft/language-server-protocol","title_link":"https://github.com/microsoft/language-server-protocol/blob/gh-pages/_specifications/specification-3-16.md#workspace_configuration","text":"Defines a common protocol for language servers. Contribute to microsoft/language-server-protocol development by creating an account on GitHub.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6154722?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/language-server-protocol/blob/gh-pages/_specifications/specification-3-16.md#workspace_configuration","original_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/language-server-protocol/blob/gh-pages/_specifications/specification-3-16.md#workspace_configuration"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vGX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49a67828-558d-4a7d-b1cf-3a0b67d03808","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、いつの世もダメな子(ls)はいるんだろうなあ","ts":"1617183571.058100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zeGru"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d96bcc3c-c891-4f82-830c-75222393d8d2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"どうも workspace/didChangeConfiguration では「エディタレベル設定」を送るべきで、\nworkspace/configuration では「ファイルレベルで設定を変えられるようなツールがある場合、scopeUri でそれを要求できる」みたいに見える。。。（仕様書的には）","ts":"1617183527.057200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"byx1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cdf67c0-3de1-4ca4-bafb-60c1505cd544","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"ありがとうございます。\nクライアントで workspace/configuration 用の最新に保ちつつ、さらに workspace/didChangeConfiguration で投げていくってのがなんか微妙な気がしましたが、 Tsuyoshi CHO さんのような再起動した場合とかのために必要なのかもしれないですね...","ts":"1617183507.056400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GpF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4fd63bcb-8180-4bb6-b737-7eaea590d19e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"実は自作クライアントは「workspace/didChangeConfiguration を initialized に勝手に一度だけ送信する」というのを入れていて、これがないとちゃんと動かない LS があった気がする。\nもし VSCode もそうやっているようなら workspace/configuration さん。。。という感じになる。。。","ts":"1617183398.054300","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1617183418.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HghwV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e798a38-29ef-459f-a07b-e9b6b96f4ee2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"サイレントな変更というか、didChangeでは送らないを選択していいが、サーバは知ったらなにかしらできる値があるなら意味があるか...?\nあと、lsが不調で自立再起動したから取得したいとか?","ts":"1617183262.052500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QQ4X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d33d6f6a-9c74-4d27-ac3f-13012d2a836c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"冷静に考えると、`変化したら必ず workspace/didChangeConfiguration を通知する` のだったら、workspace/configuration いらなくない？って話で、たしかに疑問がありますね。。。","ts":"1617183168.051200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i+gta"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3b55dff-683c-48b9-89eb-70b547692c37","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"1. ワークスペース設定は、クライアント側にオブジェクトとして保持されている。\n2. クライアント側に保持されている設定が変化した際に、workspace/didChangeConfiguration をクライアントはサーバに投げるべき\n3. サーバ側は、今の最新の workspace/configuration の値をクライアントに要求できる\n\nだと思います。僕は同じものだと解釈していますね。\nそして、同じものでありクライアント側がマスタデータなので常に同期が取られている。と解釈していました。","ts":"1617183132.050300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G+t9+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84167191-011f-4ed4-962a-977b03f37931","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"LSP のことを全然知らないので、変なことをきいていたら申し訳ないのですが、\nもし、知っている方がいらしたらご教授いただきたいのですが、よろしいでしょうか。\n\nクライアント側から見たときの、「workspace/configuration リクエスト で返す値」と、「workspace/didChangeConfiguration のリクエストパラメータ settings の値」 は常に同期を取っておくべきなのでしょうか？\nまた、そもそも、上記の２つの値は同じ意味合いの値なのでしょうか。","ts":"1617182887.048000","edited":{"user":"UFP0GQZ4K","ts":"1617183045.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nMKV"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01TL444GL8","text":"\u003c@U01TL444GL8\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1617168624.046900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"d5819c12-ac79-4e26-b5e0-af0a37bad5dd","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/pull/409/files\u003e\nとりあえず PR 作ったのでご意見ください！","ts":"1617118036.046600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: Add deno warning message by heavenshell · Pull Request #409 · mattn/vim-lsp-settings","id":1,"title":"Add deno warning message by heavenshell · Pull Request #409 · mattn/vim-lsp-settings","title_link":"https://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/pull/409/files","text":"ref 1fce64d When opening TypeScript project(not a demo project) always displayed warning message. IMO we may suggest to user how to disable message.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56591?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":128,"thumb_height":128,"from_url":"https://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/pull/409/files","original_url":"https://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/pull/409/files"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7rT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45ddf278-c449-4f58-b270-1d4e3553ed9d","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"いや、単純に deno じゃない時は disabled: true を setting.json に書けばメッセージ消えるよが一番筋がいいか。","ts":"1617117159.046300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cWL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04d65b2a-8e14-43d1-ac8d-4519d53e2519","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"LspSettingsLocalEdit で `.vim-lsp-settings/settings.json` に blocklist の設置を書くのを推奨するよとかですかね。","ts":"1617116646.044800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Az5"}]}]
